    <string name="settings_auto_pause_off">Auto-pause: off</string>
    <string name="settings_auto_pause_explained">A run or a ride with a route pauses by itself once you have stood still for 8 seconds, and goes on when you move again, with a buzz each time. The GPS speed decides; a pause you tap stays until you tap again.</string>
    <string name="settings_auto_detect_on">Detect workouts: on</string>
    <string name="settings_auto_detect_off">Detect workouts: off</string>
    <string name="settings_auto_detect_explained">After 10 minutes of brisk walking or running without a workout, the watch offers to record it from where it began. It reads the step minutes it keeps anyway; nothing is recorded unless you tap Record.</string>
